{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56087","headline":"通玄赞八首 二 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五亿诸天界，三千道境中。\n是非更有待，生死互无穷。\n妄起贪瞋狱，虚成杀害宫。\n谬言人我异，安知彼此同。\n六骸俱不实，万法悉归空。\n体道烦恼尽，心与色尘终。\n未能求解脱，常只处攀笼。\n若欲常自在，稽首至道宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}